#: conf.json:summary
msgid "A small MoonBit 3D geometry foundation with core, view, frontend, TUI, Canvas, and GSAP SVG backend packages built on Luna-Flow/linear-algebra."
msgstr "基于 Luna-Flow/linear-algebra 的小型 MoonBit 3D 几何基础库，包含 core、view、frontend 以及 TUI、Canvas 和 GSAP SVG 后端等包。"

#: manual/api/backend/canvas.md:1
msgid "Canvas Backend API"
msgstr "Canvas 后端 API"

#: manual/api/backend/canvas.md:3
msgid "The JS-only Canvas backend consumes `@frontend.DrawList`, rasterizes it through the frontend perspective-correct Z-buffer, and writes merged horizontal runs to a browser `CanvasRenderingContext2D`."
msgstr "Canvas 后端仅支持 JS target。它消费 `@frontend.DrawList`，通过 frontend 中支持透视校正的 Z-buffer 完成逐像素光栅化，再将连续同色扫描线区间写入浏览器 `CanvasRenderingContext2D`。"

#: manual/api/backend/canvas.md:7
#: manual/api/backend/tui.md:5
#: manual/api/core.md:6
#: manual/api/frontend.md:5
#: manual/api/view.md:6
msgid "Types"
msgstr "类型"

#: manual/api/backend/canvas.md:9
msgid "`CanvasColor::rgb(red, green, blue)` clamps RGB channels to `0..255`."
msgstr "`CanvasColor::rgb(red, green, blue)`：将 RGB 通道限制到 `0..255`。"

#: manual/api/backend/canvas.md:10
msgid "`CanvasRenderConfig::default()` creates a `640 x 480` configuration."
msgstr "`CanvasRenderConfig::default()`：创建 `640 x 480` 默认配置。"

#: manual/api/backend/canvas.md:11
msgid "`CanvasRenderConfig::sized(width, height)` creates a configuration with the default dark background, cyan foreground, and 256 shade levels."
msgstr "`CanvasRenderConfig::sized(width, height)`：创建指定尺寸的默认深色背景、青色前景配置。"

#: manual/api/backend/canvas.md:14
#: manual/api/backend/gsap.md:6
msgid "Rendering"
msgstr "渲染"

#: manual/api/backend/canvas.md:16
msgid "`render_draw_list(context, draw_list, config)` renders into an existing 2D context."
msgstr "`render_draw_list(context, draw_list, config)`：渲染已有 draw list。"

#: manual/api/backend/canvas.md:17
msgid "`render_scene(context, scene, render_view, config)` builds and renders a draw list."
msgstr "`render_scene(context, scene, render_view, config)`：构建并渲染 draw list。"

#: manual/api/backend/canvas.md:18
msgid "`render_canvas(canvas, draw_list, config)` sets the canvas pixel size, obtains its 2D context, and renders the draw list."
msgstr "`render_canvas(canvas, draw_list, config)`：设置 Canvas 像素尺寸并完成渲染。"

#: manual/api/backend/canvas.md:21
msgid "Run `just canvas-serve` and open `http://localhost:8080`. The demo selector switches between a rotating torus and the Dolly zoom scene. Dolly uses the same rotating cube, 35-disc wall, camera-distance curve, and focal-length compensation as the terminal demo."
msgstr "运行 `just canvas-serve`，然后打开 `http://localhost:8080`。页面选择器可以在旋转 Torus 与 Dolly zoom 场景之间切换。Dolly 与终端 demo 共用旋转立方体、 35 个圆盘背景、相机距离曲线和焦距补偿参数。"

#: manual/api/backend/gsap.md:1
msgid "GSAP SVG Backend API"
msgstr "GSAP SVG 后端 API"

#: manual/api/backend/gsap.md:3
msgid "The JS-only GSAP backend renders frontend `DrawList` triangles as SVG polygons and wraps a host-provided `globalThis.gsap` timeline."
msgstr "该 JS-only 后端把 frontend `DrawList` 三角形渲染为 SVG polygon，并包装宿主提供的 `globalThis.gsap` 时间线。"

#: manual/api/backend/gsap.md:8
msgid "`GsapSvgColor::rgb(red, green, blue)` clamps channels to `0..255`."
msgstr "`GsapSvgColor::rgb(red, green, blue)`：将通道限制到 `0..255`。"

#: manual/api/backend/gsap.md:9
msgid "`GsapSvgRenderConfig::default()` and `sized(width, height)` create configs."
msgstr "`GsapSvgRenderConfig::default()` / `sized(width, height)`：创建配置。"

#: manual/api/backend/gsap.md:10
msgid "`render_draw_list(svg, draw_list, config)` updates reusable polygon nodes."
msgstr "`render_draw_list(svg, draw_list, config)`：更新可复用 polygon 节点。"

#: manual/api/backend/gsap.md:11
msgid "`render_scene(svg, scene, render_view, config)` builds and renders a draw list."
msgstr "`render_scene(svg, scene, render_view, config)`：构建并渲染 draw list。"

#: manual/api/backend/gsap.md:13
msgid "Triangles are ordered by average depth from far to near. Equal-depth triangles keep their source order."
msgstr "三角形按平均深度从远到近排列；相同深度保持输入顺序。"

#: manual/api/backend/gsap.md:16
msgid "Playback"
msgstr "播放"

#: manual/api/backend/gsap.md:18
#, fuzzy
msgid "`GsapPlayer::new(duration_seconds, on_frame, repeat=-1)` creates a paused linear timeline. It supports `play`, `pause`, `reverse`, `restart`, `seek`, progress and time access, time scale, repeat, paused-state queries, and `kill`."
msgstr "`GsapPlayer::new(duration_seconds, on_frame, repeat=-1)` 创建暂停的线性时间线。播放器提供播放、暂停、反向、重播、定位、进度、时间、倍速、循环、暂停状态查询和 `kill`。缺少 `globalThis.gsap` 时会抛出 JavaScript 错误。"

#: manual/api/backend/gsap.md:22
msgid "Creating a player without `globalThis.gsap` throws a JavaScript error."
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/backend/tui.md:1
msgid "Backend TUI API"
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/backend/tui.md:3
msgid "The TUI backend consumes `@frontend.DrawList` and emits character frames."
msgstr "TUI backend 消费 `@frontend.DrawList` 并输出字符帧。"

#: manual/api/backend/tui.md:7
msgid "`TuiRenderConfig`: width, height, terminal y-scale, shade ramp, and background pattern."
msgstr "`TuiRenderConfig`：width、height、terminal y-scale、shade ramp、background pattern。"

#: manual/api/backend/tui.md:8
msgid "`FrameBuffer`: cells plus depth buffer."
msgstr "`FrameBuffer`：字符 cells 和 depth buffer。"

#: manual/api/backend/tui.md:9
msgid "`TuiImage`: one static rendered character image."
msgstr "`TuiImage`：一张静态字符图。"

#: manual/api/backend/tui.md:10
msgid "`TuiFrame`: one rendered character frame."
msgstr "`TuiFrame`：一帧已渲染字符画。"

#: manual/api/backend/tui.md:11
msgid "`TuiSequence`: width, height, fps, and a list of `TuiFrame`s."
msgstr "`TuiSequence`：width、height、fps 和多帧 `TuiFrame`。"

#: manual/api/backend/tui.md:13
#: manual/api/demo.md:5
#: manual/api/frontend.md:21
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "函数"

#: manual/api/backend/tui.md:16
msgid "`TuiRenderConfig::sized(width, height)`: default styling at an explicit viewport size."
msgstr "`TuiRenderConfig::sized(width, height)`：使用指定 viewport 尺寸和默认 TUI 样式。"

