#: manual/api/core.md:1
msgid "Core API"
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/core.md:3
msgid "The core layer owns 3D data and math. It does not know about TUI output, terminal aspect ratio correction, ANSI escape codes, or character backgrounds."
msgstr "core 层负责 3D 数据和数学关系，不知道 TUI 输出、终端宽高比、ANSI 控制符或字符背景。"

#: manual/api/core.md:15
msgid "Mesh Construction"
msgstr "构建 Mesh"

#: manual/api/core.md:17
#, fuzzy
msgid "`cube_mesh(size : Double) -> Mesh`: creates a cube centered at the origin."
msgstr "`cube_mesh(size)`：创建以原点为中心的 cube。"

#: manual/api/core.md:18
#, fuzzy
msgid "`sphere_mesh(radius : Double, rings : Int, segments : Int) -> Mesh`: creates a low-poly UV sphere represented as quad faces, with degenerate quads at the caps."
msgstr "`sphere_mesh(radius, rings, segments)`：创建 quad 拓扑的低多边形 UV sphere，极点使用退化 quad。"

#: manual/api/core.md:20
#, fuzzy
msgid "`torus_mesh(major_radius, minor_radius, major_segments, minor_segments) -> Mesh`: creates an outward-wound quad torus suitable for backface culling."
msgstr "`torus_mesh(major_radius, minor_radius, major_segments, minor_segments)`：创建面绕序朝外、可正确执行背面剔除的 torus。"

#: manual/api/core.md:22
#, fuzzy
msgid "`face_vertices(mesh : Mesh, face : QuadFace) -> Array[@la.Vector[Double]]`: returns the four vertices referenced by a face."
msgstr "`face_vertices(mesh, face)`：取出 face 引用的四个顶点。"

#: manual/api/core.md:24
#, fuzzy
msgid "`triangulate_quad(face : QuadFace) -> Array[TriangleFace]`: splits a quad into two triangles for rasterization."
msgstr "`triangulate_quad(face)`：将 quad 拆成两个 triangle。"

